																	<section class="item doi">
					<h2 class="label">
												DOI:
					</h2>
					<span class="value">
						<a href="https://doi.org/10.32939/ejrpm.v1i2.302">
							https://doi.org/10.32939/ejrpm.v1i2.302
						</a>
					</span>
				</section>
			

									<section class="item keywords">
				<h2 class="label">
										Keywords:
				</h2>
				<span class="value">
											students’ worksheets, 											guided discovery, 											mathematical concepts understanding, 											mathematical reasoning abilities									</span>
			</section>
			
										<section class="item abstract">
					<h2 class="label">Abstract</h2>
					<p>Learning equipment is important things that determine the quality of the learning process and output. We need a study about validity, practicality, and effectiveness of the learning equipment to ensure teaching and learning quality. The purpose of this research is to evaluate the validity of the learning equipment based on guided discovery, especially the students’ worksheets. This research was a descriptive qualitative research that provides the result of students’ worksheets and experts' recommendations. The experts who validated these student’s worksheets were three experts on mathematics education. The instruments used in this study was the validation sheets for LKPD. The result of validation sheets analysis for LKPD showed that in general, the students’ worksheets were valid. The validity of the didactical aspect and contents aspect sequently were 0,667 dan 0,704.</p>
				</section>
			
			

										
